  "selected_alignment_score_max": 0.722191,
  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "There is magic in the woods on Midsummer Day—so people tell me.",
      "output_sha256": "23e52d656442959d0a57aaa2bae8c388df20ee6e710ffdc380c79ffdea3b544a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "23e52d656442959d0a57aaa2bae8c388df20ee6e710ffdc380c79ffdea3b544a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Titania conducts her revels.",
      "output_sha256": "57cd54a7d3677c35c0487ce39ddf376d4a94f32332ad647b01877e30838e7fce",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "57cd54a7d3677c35c0487ce39ddf376d4a94f32332ad647b01877e30838e7fce",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Let others attend her court; for myself I will beg to be excused.",
      "output_sha256": "59505e79f694da1f35129649263c823ee81b0bdade1c4bb15fb8426c76d3254b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "59505e79f694da1f35129649263c823ee81b0bdade1c4bb15fb8426c76d3254b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I have no heart for revelling on Midsummer Day.",
      "output_sha256": "d07b017cc7de9617889f722d871cd040060219cadfcd64f1c30191265ca26421",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "d07b017cc7de9617889f722d871cd040060219cadfcd64f1c30191265ca26421",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "On any other festival I will be as jocund as you please, but on the longest day of the year I am overburdened by the thought that from this moment the evenings are beginning to draw in.",
      "output_sha256": "89e5b765f17691d8d0fc278d53774a08874c94c5dcd732a7df86e4cda912d9ae",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "89e5b765f17691d8d0fc278d53774a08874c94c5dcd732a7df86e4cda912d9ae",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We are on the way to winter.",
      "output_sha256": "a6e0acb1f8d21545b3e5014f769e13d484629c9a64f4fe0688253ea54f7e117e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "a6e0acb1f8d21545b3e5014f769e13d484629c9a64f4fe0688253ea54f7e117e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is on Midsummer Day, or thereabouts, that the cuckoo changes his tune, knowing well that the best days are over and that in a little while it will be time for him to fly away.",
      "output_sha256": "4014d5715287f05c2c958e46b99d5015b0465cccdfa915efe43f73f840f1b6f4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "4014d5715287f05c2c958e46b99d5015b0465cccdfa915efe43f73f840f1b6f4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I would like to compose an academic piece titled \"The Habits of the Cuckoo,\" but I suspect that by the time I finished, my fondness for him would have waned.",
      "output_sha256": "656554780882dae6a9afad10762ee3dd2c6b4b92d4155dabb463c66d5e73390a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.45432,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "db9bb3410bc7cdfb0f719c6c5caaf65894dfd1ec0aea0176105279b53ffc302b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "656554780882dae6a9afad10762ee3dd2c6b4b92d4155dabb463c66d5e73390a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is best to know only the one thing of him, that he lays his eggs in another bird's nest—a friendly idea—and beyond that to take him as we find him.",
      "output_sha256": "f82243cce9361fd74010c2ebdb18471f7e2ece29b6dc57bb9b4d67d856199e66",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "f82243cce9361fd74010c2ebdb18471f7e2ece29b6dc57bb9b4d67d856199e66",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Ultimately, the only noteworthy aspect of the cuckoo is his charming call of \"Cuckoo.\"",
      "output_sha256": "04242250d293f5e98c6c9a63fa6c5d338570a328507bfd57ef5649861dd0a182",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.327821,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f3d756f7093980b55371401875bd023843bc669c7b86bc0fdd127fa8ea2504c4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "04242250d293f5e98c6c9a63fa6c5d338570a328507bfd57ef5649861dd0a182",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The nightingale embodies sorrow, the thrush sings an unsettling tune about the joys yet to come, the blackbird offers a crisp, cool whistle that resonates best on a February morning, and the skylark soars toward a sky that remains unattainable for humankind.",
      "output_sha256": "a86e7c5051324268805cb260f31e45e3ca0f8d5dd36d68fefde1e38099be56c2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.469912,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "618b4572e4d4249f5e37b32d31cee316f25d3071aa4cd93c6b405ad3bb20744c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a86e7c5051324268805cb260f31e45e3ca0f8d5dd36d68fefde1e38099be56c2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10,
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "As for the lesser white-throat, his song remains a mystery to me.",
      "output_sha256": "bf710356bf6237ebde1f7bed910f5a3e087b70bd9811b94c120076f8c8d11fc1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.469912,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "618b4572e4d4249f5e37b32d31cee316f25d3071aa4cd93c6b405ad3bb20744c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bf710356bf6237ebde1f7bed910f5a3e087b70bd9811b94c120076f8c8d11fc1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10,
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But the cuckoo is the bird of present joys; he keeps us company on the lawns of summer, he sings under a summer sun in a wonderful new world of blue and green.",
      "output_sha256": "5a2e38dbc774650dc09bad4c2abaec7f15224586e936922f4d59f21fe627dbae",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "5a2e38dbc774650dc09bad4c2abaec7f15224586e936922f4d59f21fe627dbae",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I think only happy people hear him.",
      "output_sha256": "ee3f5e7de957bed80e30a5584a9a8ec785ad9ad2b2f3c5f2881c9dbcdcaadc34",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "ee3f5e7de957bed80e30a5584a9a8ec785ad9ad2b2f3c5f2881c9dbcdcaadc34",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "He is always present when we are engaged in delightful activities, and he refrains from singing when the sun is obscured by clouds, only venturing a soft note to himself so as to maintain his melody.",
      "output_sha256": "5fda20dd8b65f6be83cb9e8cc6d6c81fe15c16f625d3082d2f9b995a2ae87bf0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.44167,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14,
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "85c80eb241ab9ac180f5c6ac9fd1f4e048165fee7c397e74f1f64028a1c07b5f",
        "fd912695e15471b1ab0416f818a21907f3969624222d9f97f38dcc3984ce94bc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5fda20dd8b65f6be83cb9e8cc6d6c81fe15c16f625d3082d2f9b995a2ae87bf0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Then \"Cuckoo!\" he says aloud, and you may be sure that everything is warm and bright again.",
      "output_sha256": "4c287e040cc0639338c89a911c531516b3ddb207fe9474d74e71d461de98c0f5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "4c287e040cc0639338c89a911c531516b3ddb207fe9474d74e71d461de98c0f5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "But now he is preparing to leave us.",
      "output_sha256": "14198a5333f0fefaf4b1cd1b25ec30378eab8f2fb58be8ddc485a729a755bf3a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.641429,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "31cc793823db0e6445aa5a91e791742e8d749fb93e689e1dab1b5207d451d542"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "14198a5333f0fefaf4b1cd1b25ec30378eab8f2fb58be8ddc485a729a755bf3a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Where he goes I know not, but I think of him vaguely as at Mozambique, a paradise for all good birds who like their days long.",
      "output_sha256": "4c4ddf44e5dde114d206a8886f622670868f316f0340e07676e1d4300719498e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "4c4ddf44e5dde114d206a8886f622670868f316f0340e07676e1d4300719498e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "If geography were properly taught at schools, I should know where Mozambique was, and what sort of people live there.",
      "output_sha256": "0c28de74672d471fe9d3e9e081f719bcc7f221e1389d47775569063f824b1932",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "0c28de74672d471fe9d3e9e081f719bcc7f221e1389d47775569063f824b1932",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But it may be that, with all these cuckoos cuckooing and swallows swallowing from July to April, the country is so full of immigrants that there is no room for a stable population.",
      "output_sha256": "375f82a05fc0435cdbe5fbe84db39ded23bf3b2e4848a79b0904259b6a871d85",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "375f82a05fc0435cdbe5fbe84db39ded23bf3b2e4848a79b0904259b6a871d85",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It may also be, of course, that Mozambique is not the place I am thinking of; yet it has a birdish sound.",
      "output_sha256": "ad8c1f3a905a96d9cf039f2e0fd601736b43fbfbd47c0672b22d7612dbddcc2a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "ad8c1f3a905a96d9cf039f2e0fd601736b43fbfbd47c0672b22d7612dbddcc2a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The calendar year is poorly arranged.",
      "output_sha256": "a68d73c9ba92be8b58bb90adb7ad036f382d2f04f6b36e8a882ebcd618048108",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.663939,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e12a8c6d7d95dc6e088540704079313494125121416a8f7a5e8a1c4d1224b367"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a68d73c9ba92be8b58bb90adb7ad036f382d2f04f6b36e8a882ebcd618048108",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "If Mr. Willett were alive he would do something about it.",
      "output_sha256": "dc7a20cd805b2a9faeb15db17a13a733c5c8c36013e02044f4c9d60a537a765b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "dc7a20cd805b2a9faeb15db17a13a733c5c8c36013e02044f4c9d60a537a765b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Why should the days begin to get shorter at the moment when summer is fully arrived?",
      "output_sha256": "9f2df6b9b3e99b5d165f24112c0ce86e3071f9bc78bb973139e663788a4017b9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "9f2df6b9b3e99b5d165f24112c0ce86e3071f9bc78bb973139e663788a4017b9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Why should it be possible for the vicar to say that the evenings are drawing in, when one is still having strawberries for tea?",
      "output_sha256": "f5e0766aaea4e935edd948bc0b249d670e97adf2ed4b2a3681150f79d0d747e9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "f5e0766aaea4e935edd948bc0b249d670e97adf2ed4b2a3681150f79d0d747e9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Sometimes I think that if June were called August, and April June, these things would be easier to bear.",
      "output_sha256": "09996e7433d7220ea74d2e6140e804fcdf9c162a9e8cfc4492ff8d32f38b63fe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "09996e7433d7220ea74d2e6140e804fcdf9c162a9e8cfc4492ff8d32f38b63fe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This change would allow us to discuss how unseasonably warm it is for October in what we now refer to as August, making the gradual approach of winter easier to endure.",
      "output_sha256": "950d7eb73bdf51b59de8d6dd074b9f1afc61f963cb52a3369f49c4560e97cc95",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.423036,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "27374e1476261d0b7e3f78da47915951494e46b2329d7f5087b02bf086218995"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_ai_sha256": "950d7eb73bdf51b59de8d6dd074b9f1afc61f963cb52a3369f49c4560e97cc95",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "On a Midsummer Day in such a calendar one would revel gladly, and there would be no midsummer madness.",
      "output_sha256": "da9ef6ec72914065f7d53ddeb74722d01f595e2a02afb4a1a2295c7ee6e54489",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "da9ef6ec72914065f7d53ddeb74722d01f595e2a02afb4a1a2295c7ee6e54489",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Already, the oak trees are beginning to exhibit an autumnal appearance.",
      "output_sha256": "82d345f9c632cf181c7563f9c62600a5ffcab241464e41635cd2dac61999e9ba",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": 0.536104,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "09babc5b1805b6fcf69effdd88f17f321a34682e2143435272f674138738ff92"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_ai_sha256": "82d345f9c632cf181c7563f9c62600a5ffcab241464e41635cd2dac61999e9ba",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I am told that this is due to a local irruption of caterpillars, and not to the waning of the summer, but it has a suspicious air.",
      "output_sha256": "2494641419c30126645259a596e2fc09dd8510218a9fd9eaa2611f7ef893a92b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "2494641419c30126645259a596e2fc09dd8510218a9fd9eaa2611f7ef893a92b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Perhaps the caterpillars are aware of the changing season.",
      "output_sha256": "a97f7cdffc36da9ae219a51dcd0822587d261703c50fd34defa7ea3cd15c49c2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.270208,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "70d12662b640a4dee5f476cd5f4434e902ca97792655c3d8bdb5aa0914133a15"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a97f7cdffc36da9ae219a51dcd0822587d261703c50fd34defa7ea3cd15c49c2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It strikes me as odd to recall a time when I found joy in caterpillars; I would chase them down suburban streets, bring them home to care for, learn their various names, and assist them in becoming chrysalises, nurturing them in that vulnerable stage as if they were my children.",
      "output_sha256": "527c91bfd9db5b1e0bda71392e75d472f7251ce283a205ae1767c128a20f3c6e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.450747,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4cf8b17b0d43e00b1cb40a9136d084c51d02a4901467f50b96db07aee72f13c0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "527c91bfd9db5b1e0bda71392e75d472f7251ce283a205ae1767c128a20f3c6e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Ah, how dear were my little charges to me then!",
      "output_sha256": "512ba9f6d4b1e6ad9ff3414b34f066137052374f14e18d1fe09eb4b3c4637758",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "512ba9f6d4b1e6ad9ff3414b34f066137052374f14e18d1fe09eb4b3c4637758",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Now, however, I regard them as pests, akin to mosquitoes and blight, nuisances of the countryside.",
      "output_sha256": "9e78097d2a757dae6b8718f0cb3dd25f0783f0bfd354cb12efc645ef47b5bdd1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": 0.589489,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "36a7ddaece1354e8a9eb6046988f02ac7286a941a6498bda018482fd0ababee1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9e78097d2a757dae6b8718f0cb3dd25f0783f0bfd354cb12efc645ef47b5bdd1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Why, I would let them crawl up my arm in those happy days of old, and now I cannot even endure to have them dropping gently into my hair.",
      "output_sha256": "23ace63d280f156398d963c3c4ccf4e56e0277de0f67cf9b8a35ac42d2eafd98",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "23ace63d280f156398d963c3c4ccf4e56e0277de0f67cf9b8a35ac42d2eafd98",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And I should not know what to say to a chrysalis.",
      "output_sha256": "41e1e1574a9c427fe522300d83a1793f3bd202879e1595596de45b664e07df65",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "41e1e1574a9c427fe522300d83a1793f3bd202879e1595596de45b664e07df65",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "There are great and good people who know all about solstices and zeniths, and they can tell you just why it is that 24th June is so much hotter and longer than 24th December—why it is so in England, I should say.",
      "output_sha256": "9e89bec98b1144ee5880e66282ba28ff18e93f4e3703b812dd599f1ba0171c22",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "9e89bec98b1144ee5880e66282ba28ff18e93f4e3703b812dd599f1ba0171c22",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "For I believe (and they will correct me if I am wrong) that at the equator the days and nights are always of equal length.",
      "output_sha256": "13d2b3c94a25eb52c9f0d2761215b620e6d6d021a7b7242851a20c6608216190",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "13d2b3c94a25eb52c9f0d2761215b620e6d6d021a7b7242851a20c6608216190",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "This must make calling almost an impossibility, for if one cannot say to one's hostess, \"How quickly the days are lengthening (or drawing in),\" one might as well remain at home.",
      "output_sha256": "3af63d47fb2d19b67843a3b9f4ceae9a1d1ac379bdb02664e4fa13b7eee212b8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "3af63d47fb2d19b67843a3b9f4ceae9a1d1ac379bdb02664e4fa13b7eee212b8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"How stationary the days are remaining\" might pass on a first visit, but the old inhabitants would not like it rubbed into them.",
      "output_sha256": "4a14a19f1a95ced9d7141047c261278b7f9770cce5d2c834b6d07ba08bac1a44",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "4a14a19f1a95ced9d7141047c261278b7f9770cce5d2c834b6d07ba08bac1a44",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "They feel, I am sure, that however saddening a Midsummer Day may be, an unchanging year is much more intolerable.",
      "output_sha256": "921883d0ae88f5a8bd765f51cbaeda8b12f691a5ca73edb187134de73803993c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "921883d0ae88f5a8bd765f51cbaeda8b12f691a5ca73edb187134de73803993c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "One can imagine the superiority of a resident who lived a couple of miles off the equator, and took her visitors proudly to the end of the garden where the seasons were most mutable.",
      "output_sha256": "74a73a973a4b5149f88c9ec954a8b3ea949ca9287b338c8124965cab150089c7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "74a73a973a4b5149f88c9ec954a8b3ea949ca9287b338c8124965cab150089c7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It would be a trial to endure her company.",
      "output_sha256": "e6cd289bcb1a927afda8f3122f51f596ee4b9088f03c396ef29859e5167a0ed3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": 0.374306,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "840c3b03468cfea020a4a8a653286c7a5673960e2efe2fcade8c8cb62aa4542f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e6cd289bcb1a927afda8f3122f51f596ee4b9088f03c396ef29859e5167a0ed3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Faced with these thoughts, I refuse to succumb to gloom.",
      "output_sha256": "8df0bc40520811d61c67cef553da37e9f80868d7d5eac256dc862fa20ea71359",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.435,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "187c40778125ffba666956e2df91e2e30de827cd7eeb24e0351e569f2545402d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8df0bc40520811d61c67cef553da37e9f80868d7d5eac256dc862fa20ea71359",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I find solace in the notion that if June 25 marks the onset of winter, at least there will be another summer to anticipate.",
      "output_sha256": "92e4b8c3886aed2b469379479c830ee331a8a234511d042384dbcf5bb48276d8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": 0.475974,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "39b04a21f69948fc661789ea0868a52dade9fed69b1b95f9ac0b2a3c6ccdf978"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_ai_sha256": "92e4b8c3886aed2b469379479c830ee331a8a234511d042384dbcf5bb48276d8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Next summer anything may happen.",
      "output_sha256": "d704352972735593b46f4d5b5fbc49d1b679ff450eb6520435e24fde3d4df6c3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "d704352972735593b46f4d5b5fbc49d1b679ff450eb6520435e24fde3d4df6c3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I suppose a scientist would be considerably surprised if the sun refused to get up one morning, or, having got up, declined to go to bed again.",
      "output_sha256": "4d3b6f293d892564c52a138489334ece7d685ddfc75c33e2de6715b34520795c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "4d3b6f293d892564c52a138489334ece7d685ddfc75c33e2de6715b34520795c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It would not surprise ME.",
      "output_sha256": "7e04e4a8209a3439e734162b8e6aa94c5d9f7e70c33ccd527ec523e3fdb25605",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "7e04e4a8209a3439e734162b8e6aa94c5d9f7e70c33ccd527ec523e3fdb25605",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The amazing thing is that Nature goes on doing the same things in the same way year after year; any sudden little irrelevance on her part would be quite understandable.",
      "output_sha256": "65cc22ad716be3e080a976ffb2aa07813679478fe8479084529ae948828e7b34",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "65cc22ad716be3e080a976ffb2aa07813679478fe8479084529ae948828e7b34",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "When the wise men tell us so confidently that there will be an eclipse of the sun in 1921, invisible at Greenwich, do they have no qualms of doubt as the day draws near?",
      "output_sha256": "b561ac7242a27e0b5b89e48bdd75432f20513ffa130d3440297dd1b829e32be7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "b561ac7242a27e0b5b89e48bdd75432f20513ffa130d3440297dd1b829e32be7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Do they glance up from their whitebait at the appointed hour, just in case it IS visible after all?",
      "output_sha256": "0315dc4a85dc0320b50169b75be275f1dc442decfb8193a3b5b522eca298f98c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "0315dc4a85dc0320b50169b75be275f1dc442decfb8193a3b5b522eca298f98c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Or if they have traveled to Pernambuco or wherever the best view is to be had, do they perhaps wonder… maybe… and tell each other the night before that they were undoubtedly going to Pernambuco for other reasons, such as visiting an aunt?",
      "output_sha256": "b5f0082d0dd8713ffc96fe9f0adcbcf52ddb94606faaa36fc79f2dbf876ad733",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": 0.722191,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a3596276788800f352c0ae088af92f380339fa7f516e5e76e3b2c72dbc48ed9b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b5f0082d0dd8713ffc96fe9f0adcbcf52ddb94606faaa36fc79f2dbf876ad733",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Perhaps they do not.",
      "output_sha256": "a103b62f49ff3641cc8f54b4556a19fdb5d30755608377dabe01e29bed413319",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": 0.487897,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e347982cf4c173aa2d9f553e977ffb7518aebbcb38d25f9d791e02076f69eed2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a103b62f49ff3641cc8f54b4556a19fdb5d30755608377dabe01e29bed413319",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        52,
        53
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "However, I remain uncertain, and I hold onto the hope that, come next year—or perhaps even this year—the days will continue to lengthen beyond midsummer.",
      "output_sha256": "d48359e842635e4dbefab96661233b2bb29b59c7ba863b09a6b3124d5be9e1ac",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": 0.487897,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e347982cf4c173aa2d9f553e977ffb7518aebbcb38d25f9d791e02076f69eed2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d48359e842635e4dbefab96661233b2bb29b59c7ba863b09a6b3124d5be9e1ac",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        52,
        53
      ]
    }
  ]
}
